# Hosted-adapter manifests contain provider resource names (e.g.
# projects/<NUM>/locations/.../ragFiles/<id>) — gitignore by default so
# project identifiers don't get accidentally published. Add specific
# manifests explicitly when you've reviewed them for sensitive content.
